\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSolution for 7*y=84 equation: Simplifying\n7y = 84\n\nSolving\n7y = 84\n\nSolving for variable 'y'.\n\nMove all terms containing y to the left, all other terms to the right.\n\nDivide each side by '7'.\ny = 12\n\nSimplifying\ny = 12\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSee similar equations:\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t| 4-2f=2 |\n| 7xy=84 |\n| -p=-7 |\n| -8+4x-10x=13+x |\n| 68-5x=31x+24 |\n| 10=6+2p |\n| 9x-(5x-2)=-6 |\n| -3x+7=27 |\n| 14=2x+19 |\n| (x-2)(x+4)=3 |\n| 9(x+3)-6=4x+5(5+x) |\n| x^2+5x+32=0 |\n| 1=5-2k |\n| -5+x-4x=9-x |\n| 3y-1=2 |\n| (-2)(1-4x)=(2x+8)(3) |\n| 5-2w=1 |\n| 3p-3=3 |\n| 5d-2d+6d-5=4d |\n| (3+6x)-5x= |\n| 10x+5y=-30 |\n| 3x+(5x-1)=15 |\n| 23=3x+5 |\n| 35-16+5c=44 |\n| 2(2y+8)-8y=24 |\n| 4(y-5)=12 |\n| -40x=8-6s |\n| -9+c+5=2c+4-3c |\n| 5(y-5)=12 |\n| 21x-14=10x+1 |\n| x+3*2=12 |\n| 9d-d-6d+8=6d |\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n            \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tEquations solver categories\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\tEquations solver - equations involving one unknown\nQuadratic equations solver\nPercentage Calculator - Step by step\nDerivative calculator - step by step\nGraphs of functions\nFactorization\nGreatest Common Factor\nLeast Common Multiple\nSystem of equations - step by step solver\nFractions calculator - step by step\nTheory in mathematics\nRoman numerals conversion\nTip calculator\nNumbers as decimals, fractions, percentages\nMore or less than - questions\nHow to solve complicated linear equation\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n            \n\n    \t\t\n        \n            \n                \n                    Copyright © 2011-2023 Get Easy Solution\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2x-2=8\t